<title>USA: TABLE - Rival Co Q4 June 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Rival Co Q4 June 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months	Year</p>
<p>June 30, 1997 and 1996	 1997     1996	1997     1996</p>
<p> Sales			   $80,423 $80,601  $376,467 $313,864</p>
<p> Net earnings		    1,153     118    10,685   14,239</p>
<p> Net earnings per share	 0.12    0.01	1.08     1.43</p>
<p>Average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	   9,691   9,982     9,895    9,950</p>
<p>		(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Higher fiscal 1997 year sales primarily due to acquisitions.</p>
<p>Lower fiscal 1997 year net due to interest expense resulting from acquisitions and a $3 million restructuring charge related to changes in the operations of Bionaire Inc, a home environment business acquired in April 1996.  Excluding the restructuring charge, operating income improved to $31.1 million for fiscal 1997 from $30.7 million last year.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
